佛沉浸在美好的遐想或微风中。她的右手轻轻举起一株白色的蒲公英，靠近脸庞，动作轻柔优雅，似乎正在感受种子的飘散。\n\n场景中充满了浪漫的元素，车厢内的座位和地板上堆满了盛开的白色雏菊，画面左侧和下方也有几株虚化的雏菊枝叶作为前景，营造出被花海包围的感觉。空气中漂浮着无数晶莹剔透的肥皂泡，大小不一，在光线的折射下闪烁着五彩斑斓的光芒，极大地增强了画面的童话感与梦幻感。\n\n构图上，摄影师采用了透过前景拍摄的技法，利用花朵和泡泡作为前景遮挡，增加了画面的层次感和朦胧美。光照效果极佳，明亮的自然光从右侧宽大的车窗倾泻而入，属于典型的逆光或侧逆光拍摄，使人物轮廓、发丝以及泡泡都笼罩在柔和的高光光晕中，同时也照亮了窗外蓝天白云和远处的建筑背景。整体色调以明亮的蓝、白、黄为主，传递出一种温暖、治愈、充满希望与自由的春日氛围。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 441, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 448, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 367, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [444], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [140, 26], "pos": [-1363.146484375, 303.19000244140625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 435, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 363, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [450], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-2247.573486328125, 590.620849609375], "widgets_values": ["nearest-exact", 2048], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 451, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name